      "widgets_values": [
        "markdown",
        "# Paper stage\n\nMove over the shapes, then press **Start sound**. No downloads or model server are needed.\n\nTry Raw / Rendered, Option+O and Option+W. The overlay keeps the running scene. Font: Cmd/Ctrl+Shift+Plus or Minus.\n\n## Oscillator\n\n$$f = 110 + 660x$$\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n Pointer --> Light\n Pointer --> Pitch\n Button --> Audio\n```\n\nHTML scripts run in an isolated frame. Separate windows and backdrops are independent instances. Audio begins only after a click.\n"
      ],
